flowchart TB
    accTitle: Scopegate actual local deployment
    accDescr: Five running services on one Docker host. One-shot initialization alone has a migration credential. Opt-in maintenance shares runtime database and recovery volumes. Local storage shares the host and does not prove host-loss durability.
    browser[Browser on local host<br/>Workspace :5187 · OIDC :8901]
    subgraph running[Docker Compose · five running services]
        web[web · nginx :8080<br/>React assets and same-origin proxy]
        api[api · Uvicorn :8457<br/>Two application worker processes<br/>Runtime database and API keys]
        identity[identity · local OIDC :8901<br/>Process-local key and authorization codes]
        worker[worker · Python process<br/>Runtime database and outbox key]
        db[(database · PostgreSQL :5432<br/>Loopback :5547 · 60 connections)]
        web -->|Service DNS resolves replacements| api
        api -->|Runtime role · pools up to 10| db
        worker -->|Runtime role · pool 2| db
        api -->|Internal code exchange and JWKS| identity
    end
    subgraph lifecycle[Explicit lifecycle jobs]
        initialize[initialize · one-shot bootstrap<br/>Privileged migration credential only here]
        operations[operations · maintenance profile<br/>Separate operations key · runtime role]
    end
    subgraph volumes[Named volumes on the same Docker host]
        dbvol[(database volume<br/>Recoverable primary state)]
        idvol[(identity volume<br/>Reserved mount · fixture uses memory)]
        journalvol[(journal volume<br/>Safe intent · outcome · restore markers)]
        mailboxvol[(mailbox volume<br/>Protected local invitation links)]
    end
    browser -->|Loopback 5187 to 8080| web
    browser -->|Public issuer and redirect| identity
    initialize -->|Alembic · runtime privileges · idempotent seed| db
    initialize -.->|Success required before start| api
    initialize -.->|Success required before start| worker
    operations -->|Reviewed CLI · pool 2| db
    db --- dbvol
    identity -.->|Reserved mount| idvol
    api --- journalvol
    operations --- journalvol
    worker --- mailboxvol
    api --- mailboxvol
    operations --- mailboxvol
    classDef runtime fill:#f0fdfa,stroke:#0f766e,color:#134e4a;
    classDef job fill:#fff7ed,stroke:#c2410c,color:#7c2d12;
    classDef storage fill:#eff6ff,stroke:#2563eb,color:#172554;
    classDef authority fill:#0f172a,stroke:#0f172a,color:#ffffff;
    class browser,web,api,identity,worker runtime;
    class initialize,operations job;
    class dbvol,idvol,journalvol,mailboxvol storage;
    class db authority;
